{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, my child, to this world. Time is fleeting, so listen closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shall be known as Zephon, the Guardian of the Order of Four. As a representative of the Guardians, your duty is to protect all living beings in this realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness the might of the elemental forces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Although we cannot spare the time for extensive training, do not despair. Your brethren\u2014the representatives from the Builders and Scholars\u2014have combined their strengths to forge this remarkable armor for you. With it, you will absorb my core essence: the Arcane Power. This power allows you to channel the elemental forces of Fire, Water, Earth, and Air, each capable of unleashing devastating abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/576951054496468d89574b1510e61253.poster.avif?t=1764750638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/576951054496468d89574b1510e61253.webm?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/576951054496468d89574b1510e61253.mp4?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vanquish your enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, to your mission. You have entered a world on the brink of collapse\u2014a realm that has shattered into small, floating islands as a consequence of my dwindling strength. An insidious alien force has learned to exploit my powers and has sent its minions to harm my children. Only a few of them remain, and as the last Guardian, it is your duty to protect your siblings. You are my last hope. Embrace the armor and channel my powers through it. Master these interconnected elements, as they will grant you unique advantages against your foes, depending on how you wield them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/f33baf51f049c41bc461ef9f4b1300f0.poster.avif?t=1764750638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/f33baf51f049c41bc461ef9f4b1300f0.webm?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/f33baf51f049c41bc461ef9f4b1300f0.mp4?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the secrets of the fading world and unlock your true strength</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the armor is not yet at its full potential; it requires further strengthening. To unlock greater knowledge and power, you must venture forth and seize every opportunity to grow stronger. Along your journey, you will encounter various challenges that will lead you to chambers of wisdom left behind by your siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/0c9ca4df05b8dd92e9818598db23fe7b.poster.avif?t=1764750638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/0c9ca4df05b8dd92e9818598db23fe7b.webm?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/0c9ca4df05b8dd92e9818598db23fe7b.mp4?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, rise and embrace your destiny! This is your final stand against the forces that seek to obliterate all that remains.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3264600?t=1764750638","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764750638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/72c5ca6a4cfd3b162f9ed3e0e6d9f62b9eaa276b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764750638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/72c5ca6a4cfd3b162f9ed3e0e6d9f62b9eaa276b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764750638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, my child, to this world. Time is fleeting, so listen closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shall be known as Zephon, the Guardian of the Order of Four. As a representative of the Guardians, your duty is to protect all living beings in this realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness the might of the elemental forces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Although we cannot spare the time for extensive training, do not despair. Your brethren\u2014the representatives from the Builders and Scholars\u2014have combined their strengths to forge this remarkable armor for you. With it, you will absorb my core essence: the Arcane Power. This power allows you to channel the elemental forces of Fire, Water, Earth, and Air, each capable of unleashing devastating abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/576951054496468d89574b1510e61253.poster.avif?t=1764750638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/576951054496468d89574b1510e61253.webm?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/576951054496468d89574b1510e61253.mp4?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vanquish your enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, to your mission. You have entered a world on the brink of collapse\u2014a realm that has shattered into small, floating islands as a consequence of my dwindling strength. An insidious alien force has learned to exploit my powers and has sent its minions to harm my children. Only a few of them remain, and as the last Guardian, it is your duty to protect your siblings. You are my last hope. Embrace the armor and channel my powers through it. Master these interconnected elements, as they will grant you unique advantages against your foes, depending on how you wield them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/f33baf51f049c41bc461ef9f4b1300f0.poster.avif?t=1764750638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/f33baf51f049c41bc461ef9f4b1300f0.webm?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/f33baf51f049c41bc461ef9f4b1300f0.mp4?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the secrets of the fading world and unlock your true strength</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the armor is not yet at its full potential; it requires further strengthening. To unlock greater knowledge and power, you must venture forth and seize every opportunity to grow stronger. Along your journey, you will encounter various challenges that will lead you to chambers of wisdom left behind by your siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/0c9ca4df05b8dd92e9818598db23fe7b.poster.avif?t=1764750638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/0c9ca4df05b8dd92e9818598db23fe7b.webm?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/extras/0c9ca4df05b8dd92e9818598db23fe7b.mp4?t=1764750638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, rise and embrace your destiny! This is your final stand against the forces that seek to obliterate all that remains.</p>","developers":["Alex Schrefer"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/header.jpg?t=1764750638","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3264600/88672160/891488d47afda6e0d588c74c10574aeda727a639/1763198470/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763199182","dash_h264":"https://vid