14a59310dc74dbd03939559aaf7d31cd8480cc/ss_9b14a59310dc74dbd03939559aaf7d31cd8480cc.600x338.jpg?t=1764750638"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/5829e53c535c6e6577e063acad59320fa9e9e40f/ss_5829e53c535c6e6577e063acad59320fa9e9e40f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764750638","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264600/5829e53c535c6e6577e063acad59320fa9e9e40f/ss_5829e53c535c6e6577e063acad59320fa9e9e40f.600x338.jpg?t=1764750638"}],"short_description":"Step into the role of Zephon, the last Guardian, in this third-person action-adventure. Explore the ruins of a once-thriving realm and harness its raw power, channeling it into the elemental forces of Fire, Water, Earth, and Air to defeat the intruders threatening the world\u2019s final collapse.","steam_appid":3264600,"support_info":{"email":"arcane.whispers.game@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, Russian","type":"game","website":null}